description=v3.7.3 polish from the owner's report: the recents icon sits beside the pencil on this mode's home, the tile battery is the battery-saver shape (wide, 2:1) and its colour is the system's own tint, the launcher icon is a proper adaptive icon (dark, green battery, S), and a failed tile read can never repaint the mode as off. Full audit round: a dead watcher-cleanup function removed, sweep/monitor ordering asserted.
